  "title": "BW LPG Limited announces sale of BW Elm",
  "summary": "Singapore, 10 July 2026 BW LPG Limited (“BW LPG” or the “Company”, OSE ticker code: “BWLPG.OL”, NYSE ticker code: “BWLP”) is pleased to announce that its 52%-owned subsidiary, BW LPG India, has entered into an agreement to sell the 2007-built BW Elm for continued trading. On a 100% basis, the sale of BW Elm is…",
